  "Comment ça marche ?": ["How does it work?", "كيف يعمل؟", "A bɛ kɛ cogo di?", "Hol no ɗum gollortoo?"],
  "Un processus simple et transparent pour obtenir vos documents officiels.": ["A simple and transparent process to obtain your official documents.", "إجراء بسيط وشفاف للحصول على وثائقك الرسمية.", "Taabolo nɔgɔman ani jɛlen walasa ka aw ka sɛbɛn sariyalenw sɔrɔ.", "Laawol newngol e laaɓngol ngam heɓde kaayitaaji mon laawol."],
  "Préparez votre dossier": ["Prepare your file", "جهّز ملفك", "Aw ka dosiye labɛn", "Moƴƴin dosiye mon"],
  "Rassemblez les documents nécessaires selon le type d'acte demandé.": ["Gather the necessary documents according to the type of certificate requested.", "اجمع الوثائق اللازمة حسب نوع الوثيقة المطلوبة.", "Sɛbɛn wajibiw lajɛ ka kɛɲɛ ni sɛbɛn suguya ɲininen ye.", "Mooɓtu kaayitaaji haaniiɗi no fannu kaayit naamnaaɗo."],
  "Déposez à la mairie": ["Submit at the town hall", "قدّمه في البلدية", "A di meri la", "Waddu e meeri"],
  "Présentez-vous au guichet avec vos pièces originales et copies.": ["Go to the counter with your original documents and copies.", "توجّه إلى الشباك مع وثائقك الأصلية ونسخها.", "Aw ka taa giise la ni aw ka sɛbɛn yɛrɛw ani u kopiw ye.", "Ar e gise e kaayitaaji mon asliiji e natte."],
  "Vérification du dossier": ["File verification", "التحقق من الملف", "Dosiye lajɛli", "Ƴeewtagol dosiye"],
  "Nos agents vérifient et traitent votre demande officiellement.": ["Our staff check and process your request officially.", "يتحقق موظفونا من طلبك ويعالجونه رسميًا.", "An ka baarakɛlaw bɛ aw ka ɲinini lajɛ ka a labɛn ka bɛn sariya ma.", "Golloobe amen ina ƴeewta e gollira naamnal mon e laawol."],
  "Retrait de l'acte": ["Collect the certificate", "استلام الوثيقة", "Sɛbɛn tali", "Ƴettugol kaayit"],
  "Récupérez votre document officiel signé et tamponné.": ["Collect your signed and stamped official document.", "استلم وثيقتك الرسمية الموقعة والمختومة.", "Aw ka sɛbɛn sariyalen ta, a bolonɔ bɛ a la ani a tanpɔn.", "Ƴettu kaayit mon laawol siifaaɗo e tampoŋaaɗo."],
  "L'équipe": ["The team", "الفريق", "Jɛkulu", "Fedde"],
  "Nos Agents": ["Our Staff", "موظفونا", "An ka baarakɛlaw", "Golloobe amen"],
  "Des fonctionnaires qualifiés à votre service.": ["Qualified civil servants at your service.", "موظفون مؤهلون في خدمتكم.", "Fanga baarakɛla dɔnnikɛlaw bɛ aw ka baara la.", "Golloobe leñol gannduɓe e golle mon."],
  "Direction & Encadrement": ["Management & Supervision", "الإدارة والإشراف", "Ɲɛmɔgɔya ani kɔlɔsili", "Ardorde e jiiloore"],
  "Agents d'État Civil": ["Civil Registry Officers", "موظفو الحالة المدنية", "Siya sɛbɛn baarakɛlaw", "Golloobe winndannde ngonka"],
  "Pourquoi passer par notre mairie ?": ["Why choose our town hall?", "لماذا تختار بلديتنا؟", "Mun na aw ka kan ka an ka meri sugandi?", "Ko waɗi ngon ɓurɗon suɓaade meeri amen?"],
  "Une administration moderne, transparente et efficace au service de vos droits civiques.": ["A modern, transparent and efficient administration serving your civic rights.", "إدارة حديثة وشفافة وفعالة في خدمة حقوقكم المدنية.", "Fanga kura, jɛlen ani nafama min bɛ aw ka jamanaden josariyaw dɛmɛ.", "Leñol kesol, laaɓngol e nafoowol e golle hakkeeji mon yimɓe."],
  "Traitement rapide": ["Fast processing", "معالجة سريعة", "Labɛnni joona", "Golle law"],
  "Vos dossiers sont traités dans les meilleurs délais. Nous respectons les délais légaux et souvent les dépassons.": ["Your files are processed as quickly as possible. We respect legal deadlines and often beat them.", "تُعالَج ملفاتكم في أسرع الآجال. نحترم الآجال القانونية وغالبًا ما نتجاوزها.", "Aw ka dosiyew bɛ labɛn joona. An bɛ sariya waatiw bonya, tuma caman an bɛ u tɛmɛ.", "Dosiyeeji mon ina gollaa law. Min teddinta sahaaji laawol, sahaa heewɗo min ɓurta ɗi law."],
  "Sécurité & Officialité": ["Security & Official status", "الأمان والطابع الرسمي", "Lakana ani sariyalenya", "Kisal e laawol"],
  "Tous nos actes sont officiellement signés, tamponnés et enregistrés dans les registres nationaux.": ["All our certificates are officially signed, stamped and recorded in the national registers.", "جميع وثائقنا موقعة ومختومة رسميًا ومسجلة في السجلات الوطنية.", "An ka sɛbɛnw bɛɛ bolonɔ bɛ u la, u tanpɔnna ani u sɛbɛnna jamana rezisitiriw kɔnɔ.", "Kaayitaaji amen fof ina siifaa, ina tampoŋaa, ina winndaa e defte leydi."],
  "Accompagnement": ["Support", "المرافقة", "Dɛmɛ", "Wallitorde"],
  "Nos agents vous guident dans chaque étape de vos démarches, avec respect et professionnalisme.": ["Our staff guide you through every step of your procedures, with respect and professionalism.", "يرشدكم موظفونا في كل خطوة من إجراءاتكم باحترام ومهنية.", "An ka baarakɛlaw bɛ aw bilasira aw ka kow taabolo bɛɛ la, ni bonya ani baara dɔnni ye.", "Golloobe amen ina njaŋnga on e ŋaabu kala e golle mon, e teddungal e ganndal golle."],
  "Documents à apporter": ["Documents to bring", "الوثائق المطلوب إحضارها", "Sɛbɛn minnu ka kan ka na", "Kaayitaaji ngaddanton"],
  "Préparez ces documents avant de vous déplacer pour gagner du temps.": ["Prepare these documents before you go to save time.", "جهّزوا هذه الوثائق قبل التنقل لتوفير الوقت.", "Aw ka nin sɛbɛnw labɛn sani aw ka taa, walasa ka waati sɔrɔ.", "Moƴƴinee ɗee kaayitaaji hade yahde ngam danndude sahaa."],
