  "Impossible de charger la madrasa.": ["Unable to load the madrasa.", "تعذّر تحميل المدرسة القرآنية.", "Madarasa ma se ka doni.", "Duɗal waawaa loowneede."],
  "Madrasa introuvable": ["Madrasa not found", "المدرسة القرآنية غير موجودة", "Madarasa ma sɔrɔ", "Duɗal yiytaaka"],
  "Madrasa": ["Madrasa", "مدرسة قرآنية", "Madarasa", "Duɗal"],
  "Un établissement d'enseignement islamique dédié à la transmission du Coran et des sciences islamiques dans un cadre bienveillant et rigoureux.": ["An Islamic educational institution dedicated to passing on the Quran and Islamic sciences in a caring and rigorous setting.", "مؤسسة تعليمية إسلامية مكرّسة لنقل القرآن والعلوم الإسلامية في إطار رحيم وصارم.", "Silamɛya kalanso min bɛ Kuran ani silamɛya dɔnniyaw kalan ɲumanya ni sɛbɛya kɔnɔ.", "Duɗal jaŋde lislaam mo jaŋnginta Kur'aana e ganndal lislaam e nder yurmeende e tiiɗnaare."],
  "Enseignants islamiques": ["Islamic teachers", "معلمون إسلاميون", "Silamɛya karamɔgɔw", "Jannginooɓe lislaam"],
  "Étudiants": ["Students", "الطلاب", "Kalandenw", "Jaŋngooɓe"],
  "Halaqas (cercles)": ["Halaqas (circles)", "الحلقات", "Halakaw (kafow)", "Halaqaaji (ɗowle)"],
  "Méthode d'enseignement": ["Teaching method", "طريقة التعليم", "Kalan cogo", "Laawol jaŋngingol"],
  "Programme": ["Programme", "البرنامج", "Porogaramu", "Porogaraam"],
  "Matières Enseignées": ["Subjects Taught", "المواد المدرَّسة", "Kalan minnu bɛ kɛ", "Jaŋde jaŋngintee"],
  "Mémorisation et récitation du Saint Coran selon les règles de tajwid.": ["Memorisation and recitation of the Holy Quran according to the rules of tajwid.", "حفظ القرآن الكريم وتلاوته وفق أحكام التجويد.", "Kuran senuma kalan ka a mara ani a kalanni ka kɛɲɛ ni tajwid sariyaw ye.", "Hiifgol e janngugol Kur'aana Tedduɗo no sariyaaji tajwiid."],
  "Jurisprudence islamique appliquée à la vie quotidienne.": ["Islamic jurisprudence applied to daily life.", "الفقه الإسلامي المطبَّق في الحياة اليومية.", "Silamɛya sariya min bɛ tugu don o don ɲɛnamaya la.", "Fiqhu lislaam huutortooɗo e ngurndam ñalnde kala."],
  "Fondements de la foi et de la croyance islamique.": ["Foundations of Islamic faith and belief.", "أسس الإيمان والعقيدة الإسلامية.", "Silamɛya dannaya jusigilanw.", "Ɗaɗi gomɗinal e aqiida lislaam."],
  "Étude des paroles et actes du Prophète ﷺ.": ["Study of the sayings and deeds of the Prophet ﷺ.", "دراسة أقوال النبي ﷺ وأفعاله.", "Kira ﷺ ka kumaw ani a ka kɛwalew kalan.", "Jaŋde konguɗi e golle Nulaaɗo ﷺ."],
  "Apprentissage de la langue du Coran, lecture et expression.": ["Learning the language of the Quran, reading and expression.", "تعلّم لغة القرآن قراءةً وتعبيرًا.", "Kuran kan kalan, kalanni ani kumali.", "Jaŋde ɗemngal Kur'aana, janngugol e haalugol."],
  "Biographie du Prophète Mohamed ﷺ et histoire islamique.": ["Biography of the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ and Islamic history.", "سيرة النبي محمد ﷺ والتاريخ الإسلامي.", "Kira Mohamed ﷺ ka ɲɛnamaya ani silamɛya tariku.", "Taariha Nulaaɗo Muhammadu ﷺ e taariha lislaam."],
  "Des enseignants qualifiés pour transmettre la science islamique.": ["Qualified teachers to pass on Islamic knowledge.", "معلمون مؤهلون لنقل العلم الإسلامي.", "Karamɔgɔ dɔnnikɛlaw walasa ka silamɛya dɔnniya di.", "Jannginooɓe gannduɓe ngam jaŋngingol ganndal lislaam."],
  "Nos Halaqas": ["Our Halaqas", "حلقاتنا", "An ka halakaw", "Halaqaaji amen"],
  "{n} halaqa(s) proposée(s).": ["{n} halaqa(s) offered.", "{n} حلقة مقترحة.", "Halaka {n} bɛ yen.", "Halaqa {n} ina ndokkaa."],
  "Offrez à votre enfant une éducation islamique de qualité. Présentez-vous avec votre numéro Moftal pour démarrer l'inscription.": ["Give your child a quality Islamic education. Come with your Moftal number to start the enrolment.", "امنح طفلك تعليمًا إسلاميًا عالي الجودة. احضر برقم Moftal الخاص بك لبدء التسجيل.", "Silamɛya kalan ɲuman di aw den ma. Aw ka na ni aw ka Moftal nimɔrɔ ye walasa ka tɔgɔsɛbɛn daminɛ.", "Rokku ɓiɗɗo mon jaŋde lislaam moƴƴunde. Ar e limoore Moftal mon ngam fuɗɗude winndito."],
  "Vous êtes connecté — présentez-vous à la madrasa avec votre numéro Moftal.": ["You are signed in — go to the madrasa with your Moftal number.", "لقد سجّلت الدخول — توجّه إلى المدرسة القرآنية برقم Moftal الخاص بك.", "Aw siginna — aw ka taa madarasa la ni aw ka Moftal nimɔrɔ ye.", "A ceŋiima — yah e duɗal e limoore Moftal mon."],
  "Se connecter": ["Sign in", "تسجيل الدخول", "Ka sigin", "Ceŋaade"],
  "Créer un compte Moftal": ["Create a Moftal account", "إنشاء حساب Moftal", "Moftal kɔnte dilan", "Sos konte Moftal"],
